 ],
 "text": "You wake up as the CEO of Anthropic. You have zero experience. Your phone has 400 unread messages and one of them just says, call me. Now. Day one. You get exactly one decision and the whole internet is watching. Option A. Ship a brand new Claude feature tonight. You announce it before the lawyers wake up and you pray the servers hold. Option B. Hand Claude the keys to the company for 24 hours. You sit in the corner with a coffee and watch it answer all 400 messages. Comment A or B. Whichever gets the most comments decides day two and I'll post what happens next."
